{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲版清楚地解释了安慰为何转成延续亲近的需要、这一需要为何碰到限制，以及急切为何冒出后又无法落定，形成了简洁连贯的因果链；但它将限制直接归结为对方心意未定，缺少身体状态如何先行变化、当下的短促冲动如何发生，以及等待和应对如何反过来改变感受的具体机制。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙版不仅对应了余韵中的自在、20–21小节的短促急切和20–22小节的流动受阻，还解释了此前的期待未造成伤害如何使身体松动、安稳为何不能消除未满足的需要，以及确认无果的等待如何让情绪重新悬滞；但时间流逝、不能留住美好等部分因果带有推演性，H/M标签也没有在文本内部充分解释，容易让部分机制显得比实际论证更完整。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙版虽然更长且存在部分推演，但它在保留甲版核心因果的同时，更具体地说明了身体先于念头的反应、急切为何未能发展成倾诉，以及未解决的期待如何反过来改变对流动和停滞的感受，因此在机制解释上至少不逊于甲版。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3078f04a-24b2-47a8-b12c-10533e84ada4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140304184317Z", "elapsed_seconds": 42.328, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:03:46.504810+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c347c9becd985e12de03764b20f6de70c82abb136b3eed16dea540dd44ae7aff", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc